a.hx:2:5: error TC301: unknown name zebra
  |
2 | <p>{zebra}</p>
  |     ^^^^^
  = fix: names in scope are the component's parameters and :for variables: todos

== TC302_unknown_field
a.hx:2:7: error TC302: Todo has no field titel
  |
2 | <p>{t.titel}</p>
  |       ^^^^^
  = fix: did you mean title? Todo's fields are: id, title, done, priority, created_at, tags

== TC302_go_field_name
a.hx:2:7: error TC302: Todo has no field Title
  |
2 | <p>{t.Title}</p>
  |       ^^^^^
