== TC322_unsupported_field
a.hx:2:7: error TC322: field Todo.CreatedAt has Go type time.Time, which templates can't use
  |
2 | <p>{t.created_at}</p>
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^
  = fix: templates can use string, int, float64, bool, structs from this package and slices of those; add a field with a usable type, e.g. a formatted string

== TC323_key_bool
a.hx:2:29: error TC323: :key must be a string or int, but t.done is bool
  |
2 | <li :for={t <- todos} :key={t.done}>{t.title}</li>
