  |      ^^^^^^
  = fix: use parameters of type string, int, float64, bool, a struct from this package, or a slice of those

== TC326_helper_two_results
models.go:4:6: error TC326: helper Parse must return exactly one value
  |
4 | func Parse(s string) (int, error) { return 0, nil }
  |      ^^^^^
