== TC331_root_without_doctype
a.hx:2:1: error TC331: root layout Root has no <!DOCTYPE html> before <html>
  |
2 | <html>
  | ^^^^^
  = fix: start the document with <!DOCTYPE html>, so browsers use standards mode

== TC331_root_without_head_and_body
