  |
3 | <html>
  | ^^^^^
  = fix: add <head> with <meta charset="utf-8" /> and a <.live_title>, before <body>
a.hx:3:1: error TC331: root layout Root has no <body> inside <html>
  |
3 | <html>
  | ^^^^^
