== TC332_loom_scripts_twice
a.hx:5:33: error TC332: <.loom_scripts /> can't take :for, :if or :key
  |
5 | <body>{render_slot(inner_block)}<.loom_scripts :if={true} /><.loom_scripts defer>x</.loom_scripts></body>
  |                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = fix: remove the directive; <.loom_scripts /> always renders exactly once
a.hx:5:61: error TC332: <.loom_scripts /> is used twice
  |
5 | <body>{render_slot(inner_block)}<.loom_scripts :if={true} /><.loom_scripts defer>x</.loom_scripts></body>
  |                                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = fix: a document has one; remove the second <.loom_scripts />
a.hx:5:76: error TC332: <.loom_scripts /> takes no attributes
  |
5 | <body>{render_slot(inner_block)}<.loom_scripts :if={true} /><.loom_scripts defer>x</.loom_scripts></body>
  |                                                                            ^^^^^
  = fix: write <.loom_scripts />
a.hx:5:61: error TC332: <.loom_scripts /> takes no content
  |
5 | <body>{render_slot(inner_block)}<.loom_scripts :if={true} /><.loom_scripts defer>x</.loom_scripts></body>
  |                                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = fix: write <.loom_scripts /> with nothing inside

== TC333_live_title_outside_root
