  |
2 | <.live_title default="App">{title}</.live_title>
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = fix: a root layout is a component with a whole document (<!DOCTYPE html><html><head>...</head><body>...</body></html>); move <.live_title> into yours, see docs/layouts.md
a.hx:3:1: error TC333: <.loom_scripts /> can only be used in a root layout
  |
3 | <.loom_scripts />
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = fix: a root layout is a component with a whole document (<!DOCTYPE html><html><head>...</head><body>...</body></html>); move <.loom_scripts /> into yours, see docs/layouts.md

